r={'schema':'captain.independent_full_volume_art_review.v1','reviewer':'independent temporal-review agent','date':'2026-10-08','decision':'changes_requested','commercial_game_art_approval':False,'numeric_score':None,'score_uncertainty':'No numerical score assigned: sequential decoded imagery supports concrete readability findings but cannot substitute for a human real-time continuous-video judgment of appeal. No target-score chasing.','inputs':inputs,'media_receipt':'decode-receipt.json','actual_visual_coverage':{'source_contacts':'Eight source keys each viewed at displayed2x.','actual_native_video':'All72 source-pose presentation timestamps from first complete moving-color cycle of each candidate, plus1190/1200/1217ms wrap; six12-pose chronological pages per candidate and separate wrap page personally viewed.','additional_actual_video':'Eight phases plus wrap per candidate from2x color, native silhouette and native half-speed exports; full larger sheets viewed, with exact2x transfer detail at600/750ms additionally viewed.','continuous_video_ingestion':False,'not_claimed':'All encoded frames/allthree cycles/all8 variants were not visually inspected. Source-frame hash coverage does not imply art approval.'},'findings':[{'id':'support-readable-passing','severity':'blocking','candidate':'canonical','source_indices':[27,36,45],'source_times_ms':[450,600,750],'finding':'Boots bunch below hanging gear through middle transfer; knee bend is partly visible, but support versus passing leg is weak in the native color image. Silhouette at600ms becomes a nearly fused lower column. The character reads more as a detailed carried illustration shuffling than a convincingly loaded heavy walk.','repair_target':'Author distinct whole-body loaded/passing silhouettes that preserve each shin/boot volume and visually separate the advancing leg from the loaded leg; validate them in final chronological playback, not by phase labels.'},{'id':'longstride-volume-collapse','severity':'blocking','candidate':'longstride','source_indices':[30,36,45],'source_times_ms':[500,600,750],'finding':'Larger travel collapses the lower silhouette into one column around500–780ms. At600/750ms the prominent gold knee plate sits over a disproportionately narrow red greave/passing shape; the armor reads like a flat plate hinged onto a thin leg rather than a massive articulated shell. Increasing travel alone does not fix that volume/readability.','repair_target':'Correct the phase-specific visible knee-to-greave volume and occlusion in passing before more stride amplification. Preserve a plausible armor cross-section when the knee turns.'},{'id':'mass-carry-response','severity':'blocking','candidate':'both','source_times_ms':[0,150,300,600,900,1050],'finding':'Head/chest/shield/sword preserve a similar display pose through the cycle while the legs do most of the articulation. There is bob and restrained tilt, but the whole silhouette does not clearly communicate a heavy loaded settle, release and transfer. Cloth lag provides secondary activity rather than restoring the primary body mechanics.','repair_target':'Review whole-body support relationships and the reaction of carried mass across actual contact/down/passing/up states. Do not replace this with larger global bob or independently wagging accessories.'},{'id':'source-and-wrap-strengths','severity':'nonblocking_observation','candidate':'both','source_times_ms':[0,1190,1200,1217],'finding':'Captain identity, shield heraldry, sword ownership and upper detail remain recognizable; explicit opposing foot lifts are visible. No large silhouette jump or equipment teleport is apparent at the inspected first-cycle wrap. These are useful improvements over fused planar controls, but they do not establish commercial motion quality.'}], 'preference':'Canonical is less exaggerated and less visibly distorted, but neither is approved. Long stride is a useful stress test of depth/occlusion limitations rather than a selected final animation.','engineering_separation':'Closed surfaces, pose/hash binding, limb reach and mathematical contact are not scores for anatomy, convincing rendered support, temporal appeal or source pixel craft. Earlier trial-v3 engineering audit is a different packet and is not inherited as proof for these candidates.','media_export_limit':'Longstride-v1 later2x cycles clip vertically; firstcycle samples used here are not interpreted as a new art defect. Await correctedv2 export binding before final handoff.'}
